'''Rope Jump Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by clearing [[Attack on W-Cyclone (Expert)|Attack on W-Cyclone]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] grants it the [[Resistant]] ability against [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], Rope Jump Cat is unlocked in the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] after clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] in Chapter 1.

