==Trivia==
*[[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]] increased Rope Jump Cat's range from 150 to 170.
*[[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] increased Rope Jump Cat's [[Critical Hit]] chance from 2% to 3%.
*Prior to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]], Rope Jump Cat's descriptions read as follows:
<pre>Rope Jump Cat
In Japanese, it's Nawatobi
This Cat is cheap to produce, with added fun.
Might perform critical attacks</pre>
<pre>Pair Rope Jump Cat
Well, Rope jump is more fun with two people.
Still cheap and effective, with twice more fun.
Might perform critical attacks</pre>
<pre>Noodle Cats
Always fast, cheap and delicious!
This describes both the Cats and their noodles.
Tough defense and chance of Critical Strikes.</pre>
*Before it was updated in 15.7, Rope Jump Cat's original English description mentioned that it's called Nawatobi in Japanese, reflecting how their Japanese description mentions that it's called jumping rope in English.

